,704093,93],["ὁ",709436,3],["θεὸς",706192,4],["αὐτοῦ",702165,102],["μετ᾿",708780,0],["αὐτοῦ",702165,102],["καὶ",707031,7],["ἀναβήτω",700905,45]],"Thus says Cyrus king of the Persians to all the kingdoms of the earth, The Lord God of heaven has given me [power], and he has commanded me to build a house to him in Jerusalem, in Judea. Who [is there] of you of all his people? his God shall be with him, and let him go up."]]